Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So Balun's on the other side, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't this supposed to be a lighthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It surprised us, too. We had no idea Balun was a warp network's hub station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But with it, we can head straight for the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.27,0:01:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy. This is enemy tech, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Misaki was a bigger surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:02:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she was being possessed by an Iscandarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Misaki be able to return to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With her help, we managed to get the gate control system back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your cooperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your gratitude with action, not words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We're loading a simplified version of the system onto a captured Garmillas fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dangerous mission... Who will be the Balun recon pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The fighter squad captain will choose. I'll notify you once it's been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish they'd picked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't covet all the glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been decided, so scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.79,0:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to your stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:02:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just trying to cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shinohara...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to relax a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.57,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Volunteering for this kind of mission isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago... When I was still a trainee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw one of our fighters flying, and it was so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just flying, high overhead... But it was strong and noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And at that time, I thought it was the most beautiful thing in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I later heard that it was a recon plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually wanted to be in recon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A recon pilot's job is to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So be sure you do. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Goergametsch, take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Field Marshal will soon arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Escort fleet, to your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat, the Field Marshal will soon arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds until Geschtam Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have arrived at Balun on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Goergametsch requests permission to come alongside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's Goer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to this isolated location.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.14,0:05:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so honored that you've decided to hold such a huge naval review at Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now, more ships gather{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Empire is in greater peril than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And it falls to me to bring it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to recon the area, and locate the Magellanic gate in a mere three hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's agreed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can't use the gate, we have to leave as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So when time runs out, we're leaving immediately?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword 3 to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword 3, roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.35,0:06:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Beginning phase 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.90,0:06:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've lost Sword 3's physical signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been isolated from normal space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Navigation Officer, give me the plan for our last chance to use the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,When time expires, we leave at once, without waiting for Sword 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is pretty crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillans?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on radar, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can rely on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...is this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That call sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword 3 was a call sign used by the 343rd Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.67,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd hear it out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.26,0:07:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You always said it was part of recon's job to return, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinohara will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He definitely will.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Approaching gate. Entering phase 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace for shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,43rd Milky Way Theater Carrier Strike Group, move to designated area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The 124th Torpedo Squadron is now arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon arrival, all ships are to move to designated positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.85,0:08:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat, upon arrival, all ships are to move to designated positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd survive that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are these...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all these Garmillans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the Imperial Marshal doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so happy, I can read it in his coded message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like he's feeling like a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is no mere astro naval review. Contact me if there are any issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course... Loyalty is my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Delheid theater forces now arriving.\NThis is the 66th Astro Corps, from Zelloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.24,0:09:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What a splendid sight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This dignity, this power... This is Garmillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they all doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten thousand... No, maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magellanic gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.5,969)}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,An artificial object at the planet's center?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, that got them mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have things to do too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring secondary engines on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.01,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.30,0:10:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We will prepare to leave area.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.19,0:10:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be like they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.03,0:10:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly strong, fly noble... Fly beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving to phase 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's Shinohara doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.64,0:11:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, his wounds were minor, and he was otherwise unhurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give him a thorough physical when he wakes up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.14,0:11:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Eh, don't worry,"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,the doctor said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the data he retrieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,An artificial object at the center?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Balun is an artificial planet, with a central energy plant to power the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we've confirmed that the Magellanic gate is functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But the problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Garmillans have an enormous force of over ten thousand ships there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We have already plotted our other course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, we should change plans, and leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We hold our course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Our best chance is to go straight through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Proud soldiers of Garmillas, and my courageous friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I have sad and painful news for you, who carry the glory of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.73,0:13:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Empire's noble ruler, our great Leader, Abelt Desler, has passed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,As our nation faces this peril, who must lead us next?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul shakes at this great task.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,As I share in this sorrow with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here and now, I vow to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall carry out our great Leader's will,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring justice to the central government criminals who conceal his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you would fight with me, then rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.99,0:13:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out the criminals who infest the government in Baleras!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All of them, without mercy! We must not...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.13,0:13:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is at the galactic theater gate. A foreign ship has entered the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The gate is opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Combat speed 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Terron ship is breaking through the 6th Army,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.05,0:14:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}heading for Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:15:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a message from the gods,\Nthat I should destroy the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.35,0:15:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As a gift to our fallen Leader, sink the horrid Terron ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ghale Garmillon!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.75,0:15:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Increasing speed... Black 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how Admiral Okita fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Allies are between us! We can't fire at the Terron ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them fire with so many ships around!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're losing more ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? The ships are too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Split them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround and crush it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But then our ships...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,History is only made through sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships, change course! Don't be afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength through numbers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate fire forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear a hole through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships are closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shield on port side, breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the bulkheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gun turrets, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're caught in Balun's gravity well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Terron ship has been sunk. It's crashing on Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Calculating crash point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mel-106, nar-68.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato has perished at Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Had you been unable to sink that ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd have embarrassed the name of the wolf, Domel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in a good mood, Zoellik.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so very moved by your speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Desler!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ship sank...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You are quite a stupid man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, it was a double that died?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Cerestella was well aware of your assassination plot...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've saved me from a very boring trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, then... Your crimes are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:18:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But have you any final words, Zoel{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No... It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My fellows,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I only took on the mantle of traitor out of love for my country...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Goer, you fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General Goer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.33,0:18:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's rising near Balun's equator!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Yamato! The Yamato is climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Gun is on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase engine power. Seal emergency vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust course 180 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the firing vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate force injector.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Activation confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.01,0:19:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure rising in chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjust ship heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Target locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to disable gravity anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Wave Motion Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That gun of theirs...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Those idiots. What are they aiming at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency! Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Balun energy core is out of control! It's going to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of this system now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Disable gravity anchor. All crew, brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.17,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've returned... To my own sea of stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They arrive at the distant Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Space Wolf is unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.12,0:24:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes are like fire, his fangs like swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.77,0:24:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Each wields their knowledge against the other to further their ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.18,0:24:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: They're Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 246 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.80,0:10:16.26,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Unidentified Czvarke!>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.64,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<What is your squad!?>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:21.14,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Watch your formation!>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.43,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We're in the midst of a review!>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.58,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<This is the patrol squad.>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:48.17,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<We are in pursuit of a suspicious, unidentified craft.>
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.55,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Understood. Permission to fire granted.>
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.20,0:22:29.70,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1274,840)\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1800,1500)}Episode 18
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.20,0:22:29.70,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1274,1073)\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1800,1500)}Over the Black Light
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:32.53,tsing 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz22.94\pos(907.5,613.5)}{\blur0.75}minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:54.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No matter how steep or far the road is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:58.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will not give up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:07.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Endless tears flowing down my cheek are not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:12.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}A white flag of surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:24.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}I go and become the wings of a loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:28.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}Gather up the shattered dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:34.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And take it to the end of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Row strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:46.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And hold your thoughts close to your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:50.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Through your despair
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:24:02.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}A ray of light shines
